BT /F1 10 Tf 12 TL 56 760 Td (larger company could add similar features if they decided to target this group. We also compete) Tj T* (with free tutorials and videos that retirees could find on their own.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Team) Tj T* () Tj T* (Marcus Delacroix-Whitfield is a senior studying computer science at our university and built) Tj T* (the first prototype of the app. Priya Ramanathan-Ortiz is a junior studying business and is) Tj T* (responsible for user research and outreach. She spent a summer volunteering at a community) Tj T* (center, which gave her the idea for the project. Tobias Kellner is a junior studying education) Tj T* (and is designing the puzzle content and lesson structure. Together we cover technology,) Tj T* (business and teaching. None of us has run a company before, but we have worked well together on) Tj T* (class projects and are committed to the venture.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Milestones and Financials) Tj T* () Tj T* (So far we have defined our core concept, built a working prototype with an initial set of about) Tj T* (forty puzzles, and registered Codestable as an LLC. We also have a website that explains the) Tj T* (product. Recently we gave the prototype to our first external users, a small group of retirees) Tj T* (from a local community center, and early feedback has been encouraging. Several users said they) Tj T* (enjoyed the puzzles and wanted more. We have not yet charged anyone, so we have no revenue. Our) Tj T* (costs so far have been small and paid by the founders, mainly for legal registration and) Tj T* (website hosting. Over the next year we expect to spend money on app development, more puzzle) Tj T* (content, and marketing. If things go well, we hope to begin charging subscribers within about) Tj T* (nine months and reach a few thousand users in the first two years, though these numbers are) Tj T* (rough estimates.) Tj T* () Tj T* (What We Are Asking For) Tj T* () Tj T* (We are applying to this competition to win funding and gain mentorship. We would use prize) Tj T* (money to hire a part-time developer, expand our puzzle library and run a larger pilot with more) Tj T* (retirees. We would also like advice from experienced entrepreneurs on pricing, how to reach our) Tj T* (customers affordably, and how to turn Codestable into a sustainable business. Feedback from) Tj T* (judges would be very valuable to us. We believe Codestable can help retirees learn new skills) Tj T* (and earn extra income, and we are excited to keep building it.) Tj ET
